WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:02.300
If you choose to be the kind of artist

00:00:02.399 --> 00:00:04.800
that stands for something,

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.900
that you want to be yourself

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.000
and bring yourself into everything that you do,

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.600
you will get fewer parts,

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.368
you will.

00:00:13.368 --> 00:00:14.480
The parts you get

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.000
will move you

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.700
in a way that most artists will not get moved.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.700
Or

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.700
you can bend and manipulate yourself a little bit

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.000
and sort of be a little bit more of what they want

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.210
and play their role

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:32.400
and even though you don't really buy into it

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:33.600
it's a part and I want to be an actor

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.400
I want to be a performer

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.900
I'm gonna do what they want.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:38.400
You will absolutely get more parts

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.190
without a doubt.

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:43.500
You will arguably have a "better career"

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.400
but will you be profoundly moved as an artist?

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.940
The odds are lower.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:50.100
I can't say never,

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.820
it's just the odds are lower.

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:53.300
It's not better or worse.

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:57.000
It is simply the decision on how you choose

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.160
to manage or lead your own career.

